{"sha": "eb00f94787ced7d56aed7ef525d6234415393326148fc5bf437bdb6e4021826f", "body": ["\\begin{example}[控制收敛，连续参数]", "\\label{ex:b2:integration:arctanlimit}", "求", "\\[", "\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\int_0^\\infty", "\\frac{\\arctan(xt)}{1+t^2}\\,\\dd t .", "\\]", "对每个 $t > 0$，", "$\\arctan(xt) \\to \\frac\\pi2$（$x \\to \\infty$）；并且", "控制：", "\\[", "\\Bigl|\\frac{\\arctan(xt)}{1+t^2}\\Bigr|", "\\leq \\frac{\\pi/2}{1+t^2},", "\\qquad\\text{可积，与 } x,", "\\]", "对所有 $x$ 成立，且与之无关。由", "\\cref{thm:b2:integration:dominated}的连续参数形式（序列刻画：", "沿每个 $x_n \\to \\infty$ 检验），", "\\[", "\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{\\arctan(xt)}{1+t^2}\\,\\dd t", "\\xrightarrow[x\\to+\\infty]{}", "\\frac\\pi2\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{\\dd t}{1+t^2}", "= \\frac{\\pi^2}{4} .", "\\]", "收尾点评：在单独一点 $t = 0$ 处，逐点", "极限为 $0$ 而非 $\\frac\\pi2$，对结果毫无影响 ---", "极限函数只通过其积分起作用，这正是该定理", "悄然带来的好处之一。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{含参变量的积分}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[积分号下的连续性]\\label{thm:b2:integration:continuity}", "设 $f \\colon A \\times I \\to \\R$（$A$ 为度量空间，$I$ 为", "区间），满足：$t \\mapsto f(x, t)$ 对每个", "$x$ 分段连续；$x \\mapsto f(x, t)$ 对每个 $t$ 连续；并且存在一个", "\\emph{控制}$\\abs{f(x,t)} \\leq \\varphi(t)$（$\\varphi$", "在 $I$ 上可积，且与 $x$ 无关）。则", "\\[", "F(x) = \\int_I f(x, t)\\,\\dd t", "\\]", "在 $A$ 上有定义且连续。\\index{含参积分}", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "有定义性：由控制可得绝对收敛。在", "$x_0$ 处的连续性：对任一满足 $x_n \\to x_0$ 的数列，函数 $g_n(t) =", "f(x_n, t)$ 逐点收敛于 $f(x_0, t)$（由 $x$ 上的连续性）", "在固定的控制函数 $\\varphi$ 下，由控制收敛定理得", "$F(x_n) \\to F(x_0)$；由连续性的", "序列刻画（见\\cref{def:b2:metric:continuity}）得证。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[积分号下的求导]\\label{thm:b2:integration:leibnizrule}", "设 $f \\colon J \\times I \\to \\R$（$J$ 为参数区间），", "满足：$t \\mapsto f(x,t)$ 在 $I$ 上可积（对每个 $x$）；$x \\mapsto", "f(x,t)$ 属于 $C^1$ 类（对每个 $t$），偏导数", "$\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}$ 关于 $t$ 分段连续，", "并且被控制：$\\bigl|\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}(x,t)\\bigr| \\leq", "\\psi(t)$，其中 $\\psi$ 可积。则 $F(x) = \\int_I f(x,t)\\dd t$", "为 $C^1$ 类（在 $J$ 上），且", "\\[", "F'(x) = \\int_I \\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}(x, t)\\,\\dd t .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "固定 $x$，取 $h_n \\to 0$。差商", "\\[", "\\frac{F(x + h_n) - F(x)}{h_n}", "= \\int_I \\frac{f(x + h_n, t) - f(x, t)}{h_n}\\,\\dd t", "\\]", "的被积函数逐点收敛于 $\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial", "x}(x, t)$，且被 $\\psi(t)$ 控制。由中值", "不等式（在 $x$ 上应用，$t$ 固定）得：", "\\[", "\\Bigl|\\frac{f(x + h_n, t) - f(x,t)}{h_n}\\Bigr|", "\\leq \\sup_{\\xi} \\Bigl|\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}(\\xi, t)\\Bigr|", "\\leq \\psi(t) .", "\\]", "由控制收敛定理，差商的极限为 $\\int_I \\frac{\\partial", "f}{\\partial x}(x,t)\\dd t$，即 $F$ 可导，", "导数即如上所述，其连续性由", "\\cref{thm:b2:integration:continuity}对 $\\frac{\\partial", "f}{\\partial x}$ 应用得到。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[含参积分的公式验证]\\label{ex:b2:integration:arctanparam}", "设 $F(x) = \\displaystyle\\int_0^\\infty \\frac{\\dd t}{t^2 + x}$", "其中 $x > 0$。对每个 $\\intcc{a}{b} \\subset \\intoo{0}{\\infty}$，", "被积函数被 $\\frac{1}{t^2 + a}$ 控制，该函数可积", "且与 $x$ 无关，故 $F$ 连续", "（见\\cref{thm:b2:integration:continuity}）。此处可用", "一个显式值来检验该定理：", "\\[", "F(x) = \\Bigl[\\frac{1}{\\sqrt x}\\arctan\\frac{t}{\\sqrt", "x}\\Bigr]_0^\\infty = \\frac{\\pi}{2\\sqrt x} ,", "\\]", "显然连续。现在对积分号下求导，其中", "$x$ 的导数 $-\\frac{1}{(t^2+x)^2}$ 在", "$\\intcc ab$ 上被 $\\frac{1}{(t^2+a)^2}$ 控制，且可积，", "由\\cref{thm:b2:integration:leibnizrule}得", "\\[", "F'(x) = -\\int_0^\\infty \\frac{\\dd t}{(t^2 + x)^2}", "\\qquad\\text{而}\\qquad", "F'(x) = -\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\,x^{-3/2} ,", "\\]", "于是不费力地\\emph{算出}一个新积分：", "$\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{\\dd t}{(t^2+x)^2} = \\frac{\\pi}{4x^{3/2}}$。", "收尾点评：对已知的含参积分求导，", "是源源不断得出新公式的“工厂” --- 反复求导可得", "$\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{\\dd t}{(t^2+1)^n}$，对每个 $n$ 皆成立，", "无需任何三角代换。", "\\end{example}", ""]}